{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Leonardo's Island",
    "steam_appid": 1449590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late 17th century, early 18th.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galleons heavy with gold, leather, and sandalwood sail distant seas. Every day, someone discovers a treasure chest \u2014 or sinks into the depths. Global powers fight over trade dominance. Pirates slip between them, ready to grab whatever isn\u2019t protected by cannon fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re stranded on an island, armed with a bit of wood, rope, and a thirst for sea battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your first ship. Feel the wind in your sails. Load the swivel gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between regattas or intense naval battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every voyage brings gold and experience \u2014 or an inglorious end at the bottom of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful cannons, reduce their weight, boost their damage. Become the terror of the local seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your ship\u2019s shape, combine sails and weapons to match your style. Each hull changes how you sail. Each new sail delivers new speed and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cannonballs, bombs, chain shot, grapeshot \u2014 and your deadly aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break their masts, burn their decks, and plunder their gold from the wreckage.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late 17th century, early 18th.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galleons heavy with gold, leather, and sandalwood sail distant seas. Every day, someone discovers a treasure chest \u2014 or sinks into the depths. Global powers fight over trade dominance. Pirates slip between them, ready to grab whatever isn\u2019t protected by cannon fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re stranded on an island, armed with a bit of wood, rope, and a thirst for sea battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your first ship. Feel the wind in your sails. Load the swivel gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between regattas or intense naval battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every voyage brings gold and experience \u2014 or an inglorious end at the bottom of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful cannons, reduce their weight, boost their damage. Become the terror of the local seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your ship\u2019s shape, combine sails and weapons to match your style. Each hull changes how you sail. Each new sail delivers new speed and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cannonballs, bombs, chain shot, grapeshot \u2014 and your deadly aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break their masts, burn their decks, and plunder their gold from the wreckage.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Golden Age of Piracy is here! Build your own ships from the keel up\u2014choose hulls, sails, cannons, and gear to suit your strategy. Compete in regattas or clash in naval battles to earn gold and experience. Unlock new parts, upgrade your fleet, and let your shipyard be your power on the high seas!",
